{"ref":"powerup:move-speed","lead":[{"k":"figure","i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":128,"h":128,"c":[]},{"k":"p","c":["Move Speed (also known as Movement Speed, originally known as Speed) is one of the player stats in Vampire Survivors. It affects how fast the character moves in relation to the default speed."]},{"k":"p","c":["The player has 100% base MoveSpeed before modifications. The MoveSpeed in the stat panel is given as the difference to the base MoveSpeed, meaning that MoveSpeed stat of +30% equals to 130% total MoveSpeed, for example. MoveSpeed modifications from characters, PowerUps, and passive items stack additively. Stage bonuses stack multiplicatively with the collective bonus from the aforementioned."]},{"k":"p","c":["There is no upper limit to how much MoveSpeed the player may have."]},{"k":"p","c":["MoveSpeed also affects:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"}," of ",{"i":"Sprite-Shadow_Pinion.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:shadow-pinion"}," ",{"t":"Shadow Pinion","r":"weapon:shadow-pinion"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Valkyrie_Turner.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:valkyrie-turner"}," ",{"t":"Valkyrie Turner","r":"weapon:valkyrie-turner"}]},{"c":["Cooldown of ",{"i":"Sprite-Valmanway.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:valmanway"}," ",{"t":"Valmanway","r":"weapon:valmanway"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"},"while moving"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Tragic_Princess_(III).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:tragic-princess-iii"}," ",{"t":"Tragic Princess (III)","r":"arcana:tragic-princess-iii"},"'s effectiveness"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Babi-Onna.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:babi-onna"}," ",{"t":"Babi-Onna","r":"character:babi-onna"},"'s effectiveness on triggering weapons"]}]},{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Ariana.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:ariana"}," ",{"t":"Ariana","r":"character:ariana"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OperationGuns.png","w":12,"h":12